# Backend

- Keep `POST /ingest` fast; move expensive work off request path.
- Authenticate API keys and scope all data operations to project boundaries.
- Validate and normalize payloads with Pydantic models; attach server metadata per `DEVELOPMENT.md`.
- Prefer focused fixes over broad refactors; preserve existing naming/patterns unless task requires change.
- Run targeted backend tests for touched behavior and report exact commands/results in final response.
